---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Our Services" description="Health for your whole life. Personalised care for every stage.">

<style is:global>
  .hero-subpage .hero-bg {
    background-position: 10% 70%;
  }
  .hero-subpage .hero-overlay {
    background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(46,31,20,0.88) 0%, rgba(46,31,20,0.4) 40%, rgba(46,31,20,0.1) 100%);
  }
</style>
<section class="hero-subpage">
  <div class="hero-bg" style="background-image: url('/assets/images/glass-of-water.jpg'); background-position: center 50%;"></div>
    <div class="hero-overlay"></div>
    <div class="hero-content">
      <span class="hero-eyebrow">Our services</span>
      <h1 class="hero-headline">Health for your whole life.</h1>
      <p class="hero-lead">Whether your focus is performance, family, or quality of life, we are here for you.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-sunken" id="performance-prevention">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="split fade-up">
        <div class="split-image">
          <img src="/assets/images/open-water-swimmers.jpg" alt="Performance and prevention" style="object-position: 70% 85%;" />
        </div>
        <div class="split-content">
          <span class="eyebrow">Performance & prevention</span>
          <h2>Staying healthy, staying ahead.</h2>
          <p>Most people don't know what their body is actually capable of, or what is quietly working against it.</p>
          <p style="margin-top: 16px;">We do. Through comprehensive laboratory testing, ongoing monitoring, and a doctor who understands your goals, we help you perform at your best and stay there for decades.</p>
          <a href="/en/contact" class="btn btn-outline" style="margin-top: 28px;">→</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-ivory" id="healthy-aging">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="split reverse fade-up">
        <div class="split-image">
          <img src="/assets/images/elderly-man-profile-sunset.jpg" alt="Healthy aging" />
        </div>
        <div class="split-content">
          <span class="eyebrow">Healthy aging</span>
          <h2>Getting older should bring wisdom, not worry.</h2>
          <p>As health needs grow more complex, having your personal doctor makes all the difference for you and the people who care for you. </p>
          <p style="margin-top: 16px;">We handle everything from reviewing medications to managing specialist appointments, and make sure nothing goes unnoticed.</p>
          <a href="/en/contact" class="btn btn-outline" style="margin-top: 28px;"> →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-sunken" id="children-families">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="split fade-up">
        <div class="split-image">
          <img src="/assets/images/child-arm-bandaids.jpg" alt="Children and families" />
        </div>
        <div class="split-content">
          <span class="eyebrow">Children & families</span>
          <h2>One doctor for you and your whole family.</h2>
          <p>We support families with both preventive care and everyday medical concerns. When a child becomes ill, parents can reach their family doctor who already knows the medical context.</p>
          <p style="margin-top: 16px;">Our model complements Finland's neuvola system by providing access to a dedicated doctor for medical questions, acute illnesses, and more complex situations.</p>
          <a href="/en/contact" class="btn btn-outline" style="margin-top: 28px;"> →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-ivory" id="complex-health-needs">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="split reverse fade-up">
        <div class="split-image">
          <img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67812a141d8f2465fe6175eb/69d6375ea03a61d5a2486655_artem-kovalev-fk3XUcfTAvk-unsplash.jpg" alt="Complex health needs" />
        </div>
        <div class="split-content">
          <span class="eyebrow">Complex health needs</span>
          <h2>Trustworthy guidance through difficult times.</h2>
          <p>When something serious happens, having a familiar doctor by your side brings clarity and calm. Your doctor acts as the main point of contact between the care team, in Finland and globally.</p>
          <p style="margin-top: 16px;">Once the acute phase passes, recovery takes time. Your doctor stays with you through it, making sure you get back to full health.</p>
          <a href="/en/contact" class="btn btn-outline" style="margin-top: 28px;">→</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Base>